{
    "background_story": "Pinky was a vibrant, adventurous parrot with a penchant for excitement. His owner, a thrill-seeking skydiver, had named him after the infamous Apache warrior Geronimo, who was known for his fearless spirit. Pinky lived up to his namesake, often squawking 'Geronimo!' as he swooped through the air, mimicking his owner's pre-jump ritual. When his owner took him on a skydiving adventure, Pinky proved to be a natural, spreading his wings and soaring through the air with ease. As they free-fell towards the earth, Pinky's loud 'Geronimo!' echoed through the air, becoming a battle cry for the duo's daredevil exploits. Together, they pushed the limits of flight, their bond growing stronger with each heart-pumping adventure.",
